**Summary of the fix:**
- Added an `escapeMarkdown` function to escape markdown-sensitive characters unless the value is already a code snippet.
- In the `'code'` case, if the value already starts and ends with a backtick, it is returned as is.
- In the default case, all values are passed through `escapeMarkdown` to prevent accidental markdown rendering, unless they are already code snippets.

This will prevent the rendering bug described in the report.
